        Razorpay public Key ID. Live key flows per-request via the
        create-amc-payment-order edge fn return value `key_id` and is
        passed to Checkout.setKeyID() at launch. This value is here only
        because the Razorpay SDK requires the meta-data tag to be
        present at install time; the value itself is overridden at
        runtime, so a blank placeholder is fine.
    -->
    <string name="razorpay_api_key" translatable="false"></string>

